<title>RUSSIA: Russia sets 31.44 pct coupon on bond.</title>
<headline>Russia sets 31.44 pct coupon on bond.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry will pay 78,385 roubles, equivalent to an annual rate of 31.44 percent, on April 23 in quarterly interest on the series 24009 two-year OFZ bonds maturing October 1998, the Central Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Coupon date  Coupon number  Interest volume  Annual rate</p>
<p>    Jan 22	 1		  106,657 roubles  42.78 pct</p>
<p>    April 23     2		   78,385 roubles  31.44 pct</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
